Revision history for Pinterest-URL-Normalizer

0.1.1  2026-08-08
    - Route the image workflow to the SavePinner homepage with the campaign's
      exact Pinterest image downloader anchor.

0.1.0  2026-08-08
    - First public release.
    - Parse and normalize Pin, short, profile, board, and Ideas URLs.
    - Support canonical, mobile, regional-subdomain, and country-domain hosts.
    - Include a network-free command-line interface.
